### ============================================================
### 乡村振兴管理系统 — 购物车 + 下单流程测试
### 下载后重命名为 api-test.http 放到 IDEA 项目根目录
### 按顺序从上到下执行，脚本会自动提取和传递变量
### ============================================================
### ⚠️ 前置条件: 先跑完之前的测试（注册用户、创建分类、发布商品）
### 或者先执行下面的快速初始化部分


### ==================== 快速初始化 ====================

### 0.1 管理员登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.data.token);
%}

###

### 0.2 注册商家（如果已注册会返回400，忽略即可）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "farmer01",
  "password": "123456",
  "confirmPassword": "123456",
  "nickname": "张三果园",
  "phone": "13800138001",
  "role": "MERCHANT"
}

###

### 0.3 注册买家
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "buyer01",
  "password": "123456",
  "confirmPassword": "123456",
  "nickname": "李四"
}

###

### 0.4 商家登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "farmer01",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("farmer_token", response.body.data.token);
    client.global.set("farmer_id", response.body.data.userInfo.id);
%}

###

### 0.5 买家登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "buyer01",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("buyer_token", response.body.data.token);
    client.global.set("buyer_id", response.body.data.userInfo.id);
    client.log("✅ 买家登录成功, id=" + response.body.data.userInfo.id);
%}

###

### 0.6 创建分类（如果已存在会返回400，忽略）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "name": "水果",
  "parentId": 0
}

> {%
    if (response.body.code === 200) {
        client.global.set("cat_fruit", response.body.data.id);
    }
%}

###

### 0.7 商家发布商品 — 红富士苹果
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer_token}}

{
  "name": "红富士苹果",
  "description": "山东烟台红富士",
  "price": 5.50,
  "stock": 100,
  "unit": "斤",
  "origin": "山东烟台"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("product_apple", response.body.data.id);
    client.log("✅ 苹果ID: " + response.body.data.id);
%}

###

### 0.8 商家发布商品 — 有机番茄
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer_token}}

{
  "name": "有机番茄",
  "description": "山东寿光有机番茄",
  "price": 8.00,
  "stock": 50,
  "unit": "斤",
  "origin": "山东寿光"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("product_tomato", response.body.data.id);
    client.log("✅ 番茄ID: " + response.body.data.id);
%}

###

### 0.9 商家发布商品 — 沙糖桔
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer_token}}

{
  "name": "沙糖桔",
  "description": "广西桂林沙糖桔",
  "price": 3.80,
  "stock": 200,
  "unit": "斤",
  "origin": "广西桂林"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("product_orange", response.body.data.id);
    client.log("✅ 沙糖桔ID: " + response.body.data.id);
%}

###

### ==================== 1. 购物车操作 ====================

### 1.1 买家加入购物车 — 苹果 3斤
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

{
  "productId": {{product_apple}},
  "quantity": 3
}

> {%
    client.global.set("cart_item_apple", response.body.data.id);
    client.test("加入购物车成功", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.code === 200);
        client.assert(response.body.data.quantity === 3);
        client.assert(response.body.data.subtotal === 16.5);
    });
%}

###

### 1.2 加入购物车 — 番茄 2斤
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

{
  "productId": {{product_tomato}},
  "quantity": 2
}

> {%
    client.global.set("cart_item_tomato", response.body.data.id);
%}

###

### 1.3 加入购物车 — 沙糖桔 5斤
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

{
  "productId": {{product_orange}},
  "quantity": 5
}

> {%
    client.global.set("cart_item_orange", response.body.data.id);
%}

###

### 1.4 再次加入苹果（应累加数量，变成3+2=5）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

{
  "productId": {{product_apple}},
  "quantity": 2
}

> {%
    client.test("数量累加到5", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.quantity === 5);
    });
%}

###

### 1.5 查看购物车
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("购物车有3种商品", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.totalCount === 3);
        client.assert(response.body.data.selectedCount === 3, "默认全部选中");
    });
    client.log("✅ 购物车总金额: " + response.body.data.selectedAmount);
%}

###

### 1.6 修改苹果数量为10斤
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/{{cart_item_apple}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

{
  "quantity": 10
}

> {%
    client.test("数量已改为10", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.quantity === 10);
    });
%}

###

### 1.7 取消勾选沙糖桔（不参与结算）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/{{cart_item_orange}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

{
  "selected": false
}

> {%
    client.test("已取消勾选", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.selected === false);
    });
%}

###

### 1.8 再次查看购物车（验证汇总数据）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("2个选中，1个未选", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.selectedCount === 2);
        client.assert(response.body.data.allSelected === false, "不是全选");
    });
    client.log("✅ 选中金额: " + response.body.data.selectedAmount);
%}

###

### 1.9 全选
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/select-all
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

{
  "selected": true
}

###

### 1.10 取消全选
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/select-all
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

{
  "selected": false
}

###

### 1.11 重新选中苹果和番茄（准备下单）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/{{cart_item_apple}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

{
  "selected": true
}

###

PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/{{cart_item_tomato}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

{
  "selected": true
}

###

### 1.12 购物车角标数量
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/count
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("购物车有3种商品", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data === 3);
    });
%}

###

### ==================== 2. 下单流程 ====================

### 2.1 下单（购物车中选中的商品→订单）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

{
  "shippingAddress": "浙江省杭州市西湖区文三路123号",
  "receiverName": "李四",
  "receiverPhone": "13900139000",
  "remark": "请周末配送"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("order_id", response.body.data.id);
    client.global.set("order_no", response.body.data.orderNo);
    client.test("下单成功", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.code === 200);
        client.assert(response.body.data.status === "PENDING_PAYMENT");
        client.assert(response.body.data.items.length === 2, "应有苹果和番茄2个明细");
    });
    client.log("✅ 订单号: " + response.body.data.orderNo);
    client.log("✅ 订单总金额: " + response.body.data.totalAmount);
%}

###

### 2.2 下单后查看购物车（选中的应被清除，沙糖桔还在）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("已下单商品从购物车移除", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.totalCount === 1, "只剩沙糖桔");
    });
%}

###

### 2.3 下单后查看产品库存（应已扣减）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/{{product_apple}}

> {%
    client.test("库存已扣减", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.stock === 90, "100 - 10 = 90");
    });
%}

###

### ==================== 3. 订单管理 ====================

### 3.1 查看订单详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("订单详情正确", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.orderNo === client.global.get("order_no"));
        client.assert(response.body.data.receiverName === "李四");
        client.assert(response.body.data.items.length === 2);
    });
%}

###

### 3.2 我的订单列表（全部）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("订单列表有数据", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.records.length >= 1);
    });
%}

###

### 3.3 按状态筛选 — 待付款
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders?status=PENDING_PAYMENT&page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("有待付款订单", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.records.length >= 1);
    });
%}

###

### ==================== 4. 订单状态流转 ====================

### 4.1 买家支付
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("支付成功", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.code === 200);
    });
%}

###

### 4.2 验证支付后状态变为 PAID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("状态为PAID", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.status === "PAID");
        client.assert(response.body.data.paidAt != null);
    });
%}

###

### 4.3 卖家发货
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("发货成功", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.code === 200);
    });
%}

###

### 4.4 验证发货后状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("状态为SHIPPED", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.status === "SHIPPED");
        client.assert(response.body.data.shippedAt != null);
    });
%}

###

### 4.5 买家确认收货
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("确认收货成功", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.code === 200);
    });
%}

###

### 4.6 验证最终状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("订单已完成", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.status === "COMPLETED");
        client.assert(response.body.data.completedAt != null);
    });
%}

###

### ==================== 5. 取消订单测试 ====================

### 5.1 先重新选中沙糖桔并下一个新单
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/{{cart_item_orange}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

{
  "selected": true
}

###

### 5.2 下单（沙糖桔5斤）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

{
  "shippingAddress": "上海市浦东新区xxx路",
  "receiverName": "李四",
  "receiverPhone": "13900139000"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("cancel_order_id", response.body.data.id);
    client.log("✅ 待取消订单ID: " + response.body.data.id);
%}

###

### 5.3 查看沙糖桔库存（应从200减为195）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/{{product_orange}}

> {%
    client.test("库存已扣减", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.stock === 195);
    });
%}

###

### 5.4 取消订单
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{cancel_order_id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("取消成功", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.code === 200);
    });
%}

###

### 5.5 验证库存已恢复
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/{{product_orange}}

> {%
    client.test("库存恢复到200", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.stock === 200);
    });
%}

###

### 5.6 验证订单状态为 CANCELLED
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{cancel_order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("状态为CANCELLED", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.status === "CANCELLED");
    });
%}

###

### ==================== 6. 异常场景 ====================

### 6.1 ❌ 购物车为空时下单（应报错）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

{
  "shippingAddress": "测试地址",
  "receiverName": "测试",
  "receiverPhone": "13800138000"
}

> {%
    client.test("空购物车不能下单", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.code === 400);
    });
%}

###

### 6.2 ❌ 已支付订单不能再次支付
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("已完成订单不能支付", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.code === 400);
    });
%}

###

### 6.3 ❌ 已取消订单不能支付
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{cancel_order_id}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("已取消订单不能支付", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.code === 400);
    });
%}

###

### 6.4 ❌ 其他用户不能查看别人的订单
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

> {%
    client.test("无权查看返回403", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.code === 403);
    });
%}

###

### 6.5 删除购物车条目
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/{{cart_item_orange}}
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("删除成功", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.code === 200);
    });
%}

###

### 6.6 验证购物车已空
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer_token}}

> {%
    client.test("购物车为空", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.totalCount === 0);
    });
%}
